<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E GROUP OCT NET UP TO PLN 3.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E GROUP OCT NET UP TO PLN 3.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	     3.25 vs   2.47</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 3.80 vs   2.91</p>
<p> Group operating profit     1.86 vs    na </p>
<p> Group sales		   54.06 vs  32.58</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	    35.22 vs  29.35</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	40.62 vs  33.67</p>
<p> Group operating profit    20.30 vs    na </p>
<p> Group sales		  400.91 vs 264.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish constuction and trading company</p>
<p>is Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
